---
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 680 482" role="img"
       aria-label="Before, a phone on cellular reaches only the one service published through the home router's single open port, and the rest of the home network is unreachable. After, the phone joins an encrypted private network, and an always-on server inside the house advertises a route to the whole local network, making every device reachable by its ordinary address while the router still forwards only the same single port.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="ar" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="ar-acc" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" style="fill: var(--accent)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g fill="currentColor" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="0.08em">
      <text x="16" y="22" opacity="0.55">BEFORE</text>
      <text x="16" y="252" opacity="0.55">AFTER</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ================= BEFORE ================= -->
    <g stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.25">
      <rect x="16" y="92" width="96" height="44" rx="6" />
      <rect x="168" y="92" width="104" height="44" rx="6" />
      <rect x="300" y="58" width="364" height="150" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.55" />
    </g>
    <g fill="currentColor" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="64" y="118">Phone</text>
      <text x="220" y="112">Home router</text>
      <text x="220" y="127" font-size="10" opacity="0.6">port 443 open</text>
    </g>
    <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25">
      <line x1="112" y1="114" x2="162" y2="114" marker-end="url(#ar)" />
      <line x1="272" y1="114" x2="296" y2="114" marker-end="url(#ar)" />
    </g>
    <text x="137" y="106" fill="currentColor" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif"
          font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" opacity="0.7">https</text>
    <text x="312" y="76" fill="currentColor" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
          font-size="10" opacity="0.5" letter-spacing="0.06em">HOME NETWORK</text>

    <g font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12">
      <rect x="316" y="86" width="150" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" />
      <text x="391" y="108" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle">Photos</text>

      <g opacity="0.38">
        <rect x="486" y="86" width="158" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.25" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
        <text x="565" y="108" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle">Router admin</text>
        <rect x="316" y="130" width="150" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.25" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
        <text x="391" y="152" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle">DNS server</text>
        <rect x="486" y="130" width="158" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.25" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
        <text x="565" y="152" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle">Server admin</text>
      </g>
      <text x="316" y="190" fill="currentColor" font-size="11" opacity="0.6">
        Dashed = invisible from outside the house
      </text>
    </g>

    <line x1="16" y1="228" x2="664" y2="228" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.18" />

    <!-- ================= AFTER ================= -->
    <g stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.25">
      <rect x="16" y="322" width="96" height="44" rx="6" />
      <rect x="300" y="288" width="364" height="150" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.55" />
    </g>
    <rect x="168" y="322" width="104" height="44" rx="6" fill="none"
          stroke-width="1.75" style="stroke: var(--accent)" />

    <g fill="currentColor" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="64" y="348">Phone</text>
      <text x="220" y="342">Always-on</text>
      <text x="220" y="356">server</text>
    </g>
    <g stroke-width="1.75" style="stroke: var(--accent)">
      <line x1="112" y1="344" x2="162" y2="344" marker-end="url(#ar-acc)" />
      <line x1="272" y1="344" x2="296" y2="344" marker-end="url(#ar-acc)" />
    </g>
    <text x="137" y="336" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10"
          text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--accent)">encrypted</text>
    <text x="284" y="378" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10"
          text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--accent)">route</text>
    <text x="312" y="306" fill="currentColor" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
          font-size="10" opacity="0.5" letter-spacing="0.06em">HOME NETWORK</text>

    <g font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="currentColor">
      <rect x="316" y="316" width="150" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" />
      <text x="391" y="338" text-anchor="middle">Photos</text>
      <rect x="486" y="316" width="158" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" />
      <text x="565" y="338" text-anchor="middle">Router admin</text>
      <rect x="316" y="360" width="150" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" />
      <text x="391" y="382" text-anchor="middle">DNS server</text>
      <rect x="486" y="360" width="158" height="34" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" />
      <text x="565" y="382" text-anchor="middle">Server admin</text>
      <text x="316" y="420" font-size="11" opacity="0.6">
        Router still forwards the same one port. Nothing new is exposed.
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The subnet router is the only thing that changes. One machine inside the house
    joins the private network and announces "I can reach everything on this LAN,"
    so your phone starts reaching devices by the ordinary addresses they already
    have. No second port forward, no new public hostname, no per-device setup.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
